pan></span>: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐβάρῡνα</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Sanit.</i> 2.127c</span></span>, etc.:—<span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Pass.</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-tns\">pres.</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 19.165</span>, etc.: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βαρυνθήσομαι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">S.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Fr.</i> 697</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plb.</span> 5.94.9</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">LXX</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Si.</i> 3.26</span>: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐβαρύνθην</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 20.480</span></span>, etc.: <span class=\"lsj-tns\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βεβάρυμμαι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Hp.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ep.</i> 17</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phgn.</i> (v. infr.), <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">LXX</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Na.</i> 2.9</span> (<span class=\"lsj-bibl\">10</span>): (<span class=\"lsj-etym\">βαρύς</span>):—<div class=\"lsj-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><i>weigh down, oppress, depress,</i> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">εἵματα γάρ ῥʼ ἐβάρυνε</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Od.</i> 5.321</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βάρυνε δέ μιν δόρυ μακρὸν ἑλκόμενον</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 5.664</span></span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ἤν σε βαρύνῃ δίψος</span> Epigr. ap. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Sotion</span> p.39</span> W.:—<span class=\"lsj-gramGrp\"><span class=\"lsj-gram\">Pass.</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-greek\">λάθρῃ γυῖα βαρύνεται</span> <i>he is heavy,</i> <span class=\"lsj-abbr\">i.e.</span> <i>weary,</i> in limb, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Il.</i> 19.165</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">χεῖρα βαρυνθείς</span> <i>disabled</i> in hand, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">20.480</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">βεβαρύνθαι</span> <i>to be oppressed</i> by surfeit, etc., <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Arist.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phgn.</i> 810b22</span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">HA</i> 582b8</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ph.</span> 1.38</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ὑπὸ κόπου</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">D.H.</span> 1.39</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βαρύνεσθαι τὴν γαστέρα</span> <i>to be pregnant,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Luc.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Merc.Cond.</i> 34</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">X.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Mem.</i> 2.2.5</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τόκοις</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">E.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">IT</i> 1228</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">β.</span> alone, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Nonn.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">D.</i> 26.270</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βαρύνεταί τινι τὸ σκέλος</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Ar.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ach.</i> 220</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phd.</i> 117e</span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὄμμα β.,</span> of one dying, <span class=\"lsj-b