</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">κακῇ ὀσμῇ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ph.</i> 890</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ὀσμῆς</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Fr.</i> 697</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ξυντυχίᾳ</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Cratin.</span> 166</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">διά τι</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Th.</span> 5.7</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">ὑπό τινων</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">Nic.Dam. p.38 D.</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ἐβαρύνθη ἡ καρδία</span> <i>was made stubborn, was hardened,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">LXX</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ex.</i> 8.15(11)</span></span>, al.; also c.acc., <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τὰ λυπηρὰ τῆς τύχης</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">D.H.</span> 4.14</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">γῆρας</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">J.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">BJ</i> 1.32.2</span></span>, cf. <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Cor.</i> 31</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">D.Chr.</span> 43.6</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τινά</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> 40.1</span></span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Plu.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Thes.</i> 32</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">POxy.</i> 298.26</span> <span class=\"lsj-date\">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τὸν πλοῦτον</span> <i>to be overloaded wi