"lsj-title\">Grg.</i> 515a</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ὦ ἄριστε καὶ β.</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Id.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Lg.</i> 902a</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βέντισθʼ οὗτος</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Theoc.</span> 5.76</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">ὑπὲρ τὸ β.</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">A.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ag.</i> 378</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">οἱ β.</span> or <span class=\"lsj-greek\">τὸ β.</span> <i>the aristocracy,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">X.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">HG</i> 5.2.6</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Cyr.</i> 8.1.16</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">Ath.</i> 1.5</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-greek\">τὸ β.,</span> in Philos., <i>the highest good,</i> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Pl.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Phd.</i> 99a</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\">99b</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Epict.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Ench.</i> 51</span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">τὰ β. βουλεύειν</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Th.</span> 4.68</span></span>; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">οὐκ ἀπὸ τοῦ β. ἀναστρέφεσθαι</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">SIG</i> 593.7</span><span class=\"lsj-date\">(ii B. C.)</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">PTeb.</i> 282.8</span> <span class=\"lsj-date\">(ii A. D.)</span>. <span class=\"lsj-pos\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βέλτιστα</span> <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">X.</span> <i class=\"lsj-title\">Oec.</i> 7.29</span></span>, etc.; <span class=\"lsj-cit\"><span class=\"lsj-quote\">βελτίστως</span> <span