1 Es.</i> 5.54</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><span class=\"lsj-author\">Aristeas</span> 128</span>, <span class=\"lsj-bibl\"><i class=\"lsj-title\">PSI</i> 1.64.21</span> <span class=\"lsj-date\">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>"}}